    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21793" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γελίκη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλιξ</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλιν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρκιᾶν</span> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρμιάν</span>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλινθοι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέβινθοι</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλλαι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῖλαι</span> (cf. Lat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vello</i>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γελλίζειν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαργαλίζειν</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γελλίξαι</span></b>  (
				Aeol.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝειλίξαι</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">: συνειλῆσαι</span>, Id. (In the above lemmata,
			exc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γελλίζειν, γ</span> stands for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝ.</span>)</div>
